":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5598356022","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123323#issuecomment-5598356022","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123323","id":5598356022,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTbAiNg","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-09T08:00:15Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T08:00:27Z","body":"Not sure \"scene hierarchy order\" is a good way to put it, but the children being in order of index  (seen in e.g. [get_child](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_node.html#class-node-method-get-child)) is guaranteed. Not returning it like this would very likely break tons of user projects.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5598356022/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5598383661","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123323#issuecomment-5598383661","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123323","id":5598383661,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTbCOLQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-09T08:02:18Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T08:02:18Z","body":"As long as it's an intentional API detail it's fine to codify, but indeed the wording needs to be improved ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5598383661/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5600107266","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123323#issuecomment-5600107266","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123323","id":5600107266,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABTcrbAg","user":{"login":"Mickeon","id":66727710,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2NzI3NzEw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66727710?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Mickeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mickeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-09T10:06:19Z","updated_at":"2026-09-09T10:06:19Z","body":"I'm not okay with this PR.\r\n- \"Scene hierarchy order\" poses more questions than it appears to solve. What is \"scene hierarchy order\"? Should I know about it? Is it documented anywhere else? Why is it specified here, but not anywhere else in the page? Do other methods not operate in this same order?\r\n- Returning them in _order_ is to be expected. Many systems rely on \"order\" in the scene tree, so users will get familiar with the concept on their own. If the method didn't return in a consistent order, that would be what should be documented, instead.\r\n\r\nJust for argument, the reason it _may_ have been specified in `SceneTree.get_nodes_in_group()` is because there is ambiguity: it is fair to assume that the nodes would be returned by the order they were **added to the group**. It's not perfect, I am not a fan of the wording there, either. However, I do not personally see any ambiguity in ``Node.get_children()``","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5600107266/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6177608596","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123323#issuecomment-6177608596","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123323","id":6177608596,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABcDbTlA","user":{"login":"bs","id":68,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs","html_url":"https://github.com/bs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-14T20:22:34Z","updated_at":"2026-10-14T20:22:34Z","body":"I copied that language from [get_nodes_in_group](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_scenetree.html#class-scenetree-method-get-nodes-in-group), since it had already been approved I figured it'd be the path of least friction.\r\n\r\nWhat about \"ordered by index\" and linking to [get_index](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_node.html#class-node-method-get-index)\r\n\r\nOr ...\r\nSorted by the node's order order among its siblings (which is from get_index)\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6177608596/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]